# Healthcare compliance (India)

**DPDP:** Health data = sensitive personal data; collect minimum necessary; patients can view/download/request deletion; deletion within 72h (soft-delete + anonymize PII); log processing for audit.

**Telemedicine (2020):** Licensed prescriber registration on prescriptions; Schedule H/H1 needs explicit consent logs; video consent before call starts; AI must not substitute a licensed doctor.

**Security:** HTTPS-only (reject HTTP in prod); encrypt sensitive fields at rest; no patient data in logs or URL query params; prescription links signed and short-lived (e.g. ≤1h).
